<title>HONG KONG: Sun Hung Kai &amp; Co shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Sun Hung Kai &amp; Co shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Sun Hung Kai &amp; Co Ltd has been suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said before the market opened on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
